OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSkies
OL,6,Fbecoming increasingly clear this
OL,7,Fevening, leaving a dry and fine night.
OL,8,FWith light winds it should turn rather
OL,9,Fchilly by morning, particularly in
OL,10,Frural areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FFine, dry and largely sunny
OL,13,Fafter a fairly cool start. The
OL,14,Fsunshine perhaps turning slightly hazy
OL,15,Fat times, but a pleasantly warm day
OL,16,Foverall with mainly light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
