OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry,
OL,6,Fvery warm and largely sunny on Friday.
OL,7,FOften dry and bright over the weekend,
OL,8,Falthough a chance of rain on Sunday.
OL,9,FMainly light winds, temperatures still
OL,10,Fabove average.
